			"notes": "Bug fix [Issue 24](https://github.com/TheFogIOF/AlloySmelter/issues/24)\n\nChanging the recipe input logic: now it is order‑independent, which means that regardless of the arrangement of items in the slots, the correct recipe will be used. For example, there is a recipe [1x Iron, 3x Copper] -> Diamond; if the iron is in slot 5 and the 3 copper items are in slot 1, we will get a diamond as the output."
